{"node_id": "real_071_batch_66_NIHMLPWinter2021_19_HY_003", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0004"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0004_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "says. “They could come to the house,\ndiagnose a problem, and prescribe and\nprovide treatment. We didn’t have to\ngo to the hospital for every problem.”\nHaving home-based medical support\nallowed the family to treat problems\nin their own home, which became\nespecially important as Jake got older.", "semantic_text": "says. “They could come to the house, diagnose a problem, and prescribe and provide treatment. We didn’t have to go to the hospital for every problem.” Having home-based medical support allowed the family to treat problems in their own home, which became especially important as Jake got older.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0004_geometry", "bbox": [107, 617, 429, 818], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0004"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_82/hybrid/real_071_batch_66_NIHMLPWinter2021/page_0019/decisions.json"}
