{"node_id": "real_071_batch_66_NIHMLPWinter2021_19_HY_005", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0007", "D0008"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0007_F001", "D0008_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "“In 25 years of caring for a child\nwith limited life expectancy, these\nwere two of the more meaningful and\npivotal people I had the opportunity\nto work with,” Barbara says. They\nwere open to and encouraged\nphilosophical discussion about Jake's\neventual end of life.", "semantic_text": "“In 25 years of caring for a child with limited life expectancy, these were two of the more meaningful and pivotal people I had the opportunity to work with,” Barbara says. They were open to and encouraged\nphilosophical discussion about Jake's eventual end of life.", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0007_geometry", "bbox": [107, 935, 427, 1084], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0007"}, {"member_id": "D0008_geometry", "bbox": [463, 764, 785, 814], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0008"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_82/hybrid/real_071_batch_66_NIHMLPWinter2021/page_0019/decisions.json"}
{"node_id": "real_071_batch_66_NIHMLPWinter2021_19_HY_006", "node_type": "evidence", "status": "HYBRID_SHADOW_CANDIDATE", "unit_type": "TEXT", "source_atom_ids": ["D0011"], "source_fragment_ids": ["D0011_F001"], "source_visual_bundle_ids": [], "plain_text": "\"They helped us consider and\ndefine our goals of care,\" Barbara\nsays. \"From these conversations,\nwe felt at peace with past decisions\nand better equipped to make future\ndecisions on Jake's behalf. It was\na relief to have these discussions\nin periods of calm, rather than in\nmoments of crisis.\"", "semantic_text": "\"They helped us consider and define our goals of care,\" Barbara says. \"From these conversations, we felt at peace with past decisions and better equipped to make future decisions on Jake's behalf. It was a relief to have these discussions in periods of calm, rather than in moments of crisis.\"", "visual_description": null, "geometry_members": [{"member_id": "D0011_geometry", "bbox": [463, 815, 769, 1037], "bbox_source": "dolphin_v2_resized_image_pixels", "source_atom_id": "D0011"}], "native_visual_components": [], "production_modified": false, "visual_description_status": "UNVERIFIED_RETRIEVAL_HINT", "node_policy": "bounded-v2", "scoring_mode": "embedding_geometry", "hybrid_model_decision_file": "/hkfs/home/project/hk-project-p0025545/dv3352/Project/remote_runs/node-first-realpdf-20261118/output/nodes_prepared_incremental_non_nasa_after_all_parse_20261119/batch_82/hybrid/real_071_batch_66_NIHMLPWinter2021/page_0019/decisions.json"}
